00:03:51.177 --> 00:03:53.059
Thank you so much for
picking up a copy of my book,

00:03:53.059 --> 00:03:54.095
Your One Word.

00:03:54.095 --> 00:03:55.861
I really, really, really appreciate it,

00:03:55.861 --> 00:03:57.675
and I hope your enjoying the read.

00:03:57.675 --> 00:03:59.028
