00:04:09.796 --> 00:04:11.721
- Shot of Entspresso!

00:04:11.721 --> 00:04:14.317
♫ I wake up every morning

00:04:14.317 --> 00:04:17.825
♫ Espresso keep me goin'

00:04:17.825 --> 00:04:20.020
